/-!
# Prime-power scale alignment with the paired runtime

Every positive prime power `q = p^k` is already generated by the arithmetic
cofinal history.  The q-rich runtime stage `q^2 - 3` has successor scale
`q^2`, so its square-root scale is the same integral scale unit as the
theta/Müntz prime-power face.  Consequently the paired joint source boundary
at the identity reads literally `delta 1 - delta q`.

This file only installs that common scale and integral boundary.  It does not
claim a character vanishing, quadratic trace decomposition, or residual
settlement.
-/

set_option autoImplicit false

namespace SaturationMonoid
namespace ResponsibilityLifecycle
namespace LivingLawEvolution
namespace ConstructiveRoot
namespace NoIslandNoMagic
namespace CanonicalRiemann
namespace AllPlace
namespace WeilQuadratic
